<title>USA: Falcon authorizes 300,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>Falcon authorizes 300,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Falcon Products Inc said its board authorized the repurchase of up to 300,000 shares of the company's common stock in open market or private transactions.</p>
<p>In September 1995, the company's board had previously authorized a buyback of 275,000 common shares. The company said it bought back about 272,000 under the prior program.</p>
<p>At October 28, Falcon, a manufacturer of products for the hospitality, lodging, foodservice and office furniture industries, had 9.8 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
